                        "entry_id": "e2028596-5e05-3789-ab18-2c0c91c62aac",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Covered in jewels, especially as decoration."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a1569f7-13c2-451c-9edf-c40f8e9fdea0",
                                "sense_id": "a089cedf-f0be-37af-9dbe-904f3e4a06a0",
                                "text": "It is their silly pope and the rich, bejeweled bishops who are to blame and not the Catholic people."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c782ef2f-d016-4d20-bc43-1af7851fc31a",
                                "sense_id": "a089cedf-f0be-37af-9dbe-904f3e4a06a0",
                                "text": "Saturday, he was at the center. And amid a day of carefully staged celebration, he looked somber, even weighed down by it. Each piece of royal hardware presented to him during his installation — orb, bejeweled sword, robes upon robes — seemed to add psychic poundage."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
